{
  "name": "Curse Bringer",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The damage die of your pact weapon increases by one size. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with your pact weapon, you can force it to make a Charisma Saving Throw. The DC equals 8 + Proficiency + your spellcasting ability + the weapon's enhancement bonus. On a failed save, the target is cursed until the start of your next turn. While the target is cursed, it has to roll a d4 every time it makes an Attack Roll or Saving Throw and subtract the result from the total.</p>",
